{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3b298416f94cfef7","name":"The Naboo Resistance","source":{"id":"source:reference-3b298416f94cfef7","title":"The Naboo Resistance","revision":24059,"timestamp":"2024-10-20T14:24:12Z","sha256":"d9e1d4fabb86f79c7facecb7d3d93b85921222ba744dc973b05606f1e60ed7d8","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24059","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Naboo%20Resistance&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3b298416f94cfef7","blocks":[{"tag":"h4","children":["Description"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The resistance movement on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," ten years before the outbreak of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"}," is a good example of a short-term organization that deals in intrigue. Formed during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Trade Federation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Trade_Federation","referenceId":"reference:fb5a14e3938c63ab"}," blockade and occupation of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"},", The Naboo Resistance is formed by the volunteer security forces of Theed and encompasses a planet-wide insurgency against the occupying forces. Although The Naboo Resistance only exists for a short time, the resourceful members of this organization stage a campaign of covert operations, espionage, sabotage, and armed resistance against the droid armies occupying their home planet.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Naboo Resistance first forms in Theed, when Jedi Knights free the Queen of Naboo and many of her security forces from Federation captivity. These freed security forces in turn contact other security forces in other cities, creating a growing network of resistance cells that spreads across the planet in days. Thanks to their security training, the personnel of The Naboo Resistance are highly organized and create an underground paramilitary force that carries out a campaign of complex operations against The Trade Federation's forces. The Naboo Resistance already has an organizational structure in place at the time it is formed (using the same hierarchy as the existing security forces), meaning that the Resistance suffers none of the organizational growing pains of other subversive groups.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Although most of the organization is made up of former security personnel, volunteers from across ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," quickly flock to the Resistance, providing either direct support or funneling food and supplies to Resistance members. The Naboo Resistance includes a small cadre of skilled pilots and mechanics, allowing them to use what ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," the Resistance has to devastating effect. The Resistance does garner some off-world assistance, particularly in the form of mercenaries who work against ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Trade Federation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Trade_Federation","referenceId":"reference:fb5a14e3938c63ab"},", but for the most part its membership is confined to citizens of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"},". Late in the occupation, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gungans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gungans"}," join forces with the existing movement, but their involvement in the Resistance is short-lived as the occupation ends within days of the accord between the people of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gungans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gungans"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Goals"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Naboo Resistance's primary goal is to free the people of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," from the occupation of the Trade Federation. Their short-term goals include disrupting Federation communications, smuggling supplies to other Resistance cells, hiding Resistance members from Droid security forces, and ensuring that the people of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," suffer as few casualties as possible.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Methods"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["During the land-based portion of its strategies, The Naboo Resistance prefers hit-and-run tactics, diversions, and an alliance with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gungans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gungans"}," and their Grand Army. To free their planet from ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Trade Federation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Trade_Federation","referenceId":"reference:fb5a14e3938c63ab"},", the Resistance is not above accepting aid from mercenaries, such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Lok Revenants"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Lok_Revenants","referenceId":"reference:f35373d7b93f6a5a"},". The movement's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," include ",{"tag":"a","children":["V-19 Landspeeders"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/V-19_Landspeeders?action=edit&redlink=1"}," for land-based attacks and Naboo Royal ",{"tag":"a","children":["N-1 Royal Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/N-1_Royal_Starfighters"},", part of the Royal Space Fighter Corps, which are used in the assault against The Trade Federation's Droid Control Ship.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Notable Members"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Although The Naboo Resistance's key members are its Queen and governor, many others assist them in freeing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," from the Trade Federation's grip. In addition to those described below, Jedi Master ",{"tag":"a","children":["Qui-Gon Jinn"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Qui-Gon_Jinn?action=edit&redlink=1"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Obi-Wan Kenobi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Obi-Wan_Kenobi","referenceId":"reference:6e84377ee76928db"},", and pilots of Bravo Squadron (the group led by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ric Olié"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ric_Oli%C3%A9?action=edit&redlink=1"},") lend their aid to the Resistance.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Gregar Typho"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gregar_Typho","referenceId":"reference:7eae36a657bfcb56"}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Naboo lieutenant Gregar Typho is the nephew of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Captain Panaka"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Captain_Panaka"},". During the resistance, Typho is injured and loses his left eye.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jar Jar Binks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jar_Jar_Binks","referenceId":"reference:3fc883017bc76103"}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Recently promoted General Jar Jar Binks of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gungan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gungan","referenceId":"reference:f835c102d9e50780"}," Grand Army helps lead the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gungan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gungan","referenceId":"reference:f835c102d9e50780"}," forces as they fend off the Battle Droids of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Trade Federation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Trade_Federation","referenceId":"reference:fb5a14e3938c63ab"},". Binks also accompanies Queen ",{"tag":"a","children":["Padmé Amidala"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Padm%C3%A9_Amidala","referenceId":"reference:9ec3198cc43d2391"}," as she attempts, through political means, to convince the Republic Senate to free their world.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Nym"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nym","referenceId":"reference:cb76da4fb487eca2"}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Although the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feeorin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feeorin","referenceId":"reference:00b3e70f2d041f58"}," pirate Nym is not officially a member of The Naboo Resistance, he attacks ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Trade Federation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Trade_Federation","referenceId":"reference:fb5a14e3938c63ab"}," blockade several times and is later declared a hero of the resistance. He works with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vana Sage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vana_Sage?action=edit&redlink=1"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rhys Dallows"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rhys_Dallows?action=edit&redlink=1"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reti"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reti?action=edit&redlink=1"}," against the blockade. Their attacks include striking a Trade Federation freighter convoy, attacking other convoys and escorts, disabling missile frigates, and attacking part of the Battle Droid forces destined for the Battle of Grassy Plains. Nym is responsible for destroying heavy artillery guns, ",{"tag":"a","children":["AATs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/AATs"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Scarab"]},"-Class Droid Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scarab-Class_Droid_Starfighters?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Padmé Amidala"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Padm%C3%A9_Amidala","referenceId":"reference:9ec3198cc43d2391"}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Padmé Naberrie, also known as Queen Amidala of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"},", leads The Naboo Resistance to free her people from control of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Trade Federation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Trade_Federation","referenceId":"reference:fb5a14e3938c63ab"},". When her appeal to the Republic Senate fails, she takes matters into her own hands and forms an alliance with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gungans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gungans"},", with whom her people share the world. Together, they face the invading Battle Droids.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Captain Panaka"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Captain_Panaka"}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Captain Panaka is head of the Royal Naboo Security Forces and uncle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gregar Typho"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gregar_Typho","referenceId":"reference:7eae36a657bfcb56"},". He and his men are overwhelmed by Battle Droid leader OOM-9's forces and captured along with the Queen. Later, after being freed by the Jedi, he helps create the battle plan and coordinate the liberation of the capital city. Panaka also assists the Queen and the Jedi in freeing the captured pilots to launch an attack against the Droid Control Ship in orbit.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Ric Olié"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ric_Oli%C3%A9?action=edit&redlink=1"}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Naboo Royal Space Fighter Corps Commander Ric Olié is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," pilot who serves in the Royal Naboo Security Forces. Olié leads the space battle against ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Trade Federation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Trade_Federation","referenceId":"reference:fb5a14e3938c63ab"}," Droid Control Ship to save the overwhelmed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gungans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gungans"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Roos Tarpals"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Roos_Tarpals?action=edit&redlink=1"}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Captain Roos Tarpals is one of the leaders in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gungan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gungan","referenceId":"reference:f835c102d9e50780"}," Grand Army. Tarpals, an old friend of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jar Jar Binks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jar_Jar_Binks","referenceId":"reference:3fc883017bc76103"},", serves bravely in the battle to repel Trade Federation forces.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rugor Nass"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rugor_Nass?action=edit&redlink=1"}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Gungan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gungan","referenceId":"reference:f835c102d9e50780"}," High Council Boss Rugor Nass makes an alliance with The Naboo Resistance to defeat the Trade Federation invaders. After being petitioned by Queen ",{"tag":"a","children":["Padmé Amidala"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Padm%C3%A9_Amidala","referenceId":"reference:9ec3198cc43d2391"}," and outcast ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jar Jar Binks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jar_Jar_Binks","referenceId":"reference:3fc883017bc76103"},", Nass comes to realize that the inhabitants of the world need to join against their common enemy. He commits the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gungan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gungan","referenceId":"reference:f835c102d9e50780"}," Grand Army to repel the Battle Droid invasion forces.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sio Bibble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sio_Bibble?action=edit&redlink=1"}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Naboo Governor Sio Bibble begins formation of The Naboo Resistance while Queen ",{"tag":"a","children":["Padmé Amidala"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Padm%C3%A9_Amidala","referenceId":"reference:9ec3198cc43d2391"}," attempts to end ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Trade Federation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Trade_Federation","referenceId":"reference:fb5a14e3938c63ab"}," occupation of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," through political means.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Using the Naboo Resistance"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Naboo Resistance members are likely to be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gungan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gungan","referenceId":"reference:f835c102d9e50780"}," and can be of most ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heroic Classes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heroic_Classes","referenceId":"reference:3db50eedfbef40fc"},". A hero who takes the role of a Naboo freedom fighter will need strong tactics to deal with Battle Droid forces or a silver tongue to deal with Trade Federation leaders. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenges"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenges","referenceId":"reference:f25acdf2810584ed"}," can create a series of events leading up to a rescue attempt by The Naboo Resistance.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["During the resistance, the people of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," ally with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gungans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gungans"}," and accept help from mercenaries such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nym"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nym","referenceId":"reference:cb76da4fb487eca2"},". They also take aid from the Jedi Council, but they do not necessarily follow Jedi advice. They are independent in nature, as the example set forth by their Queen demonstrates. The citizens of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," are members of the Republic, but the invasion lessens their taste for politics and weakens their faith in the galactic government. Most of the inhabitants of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," would ally with a Republic official, but some might feel differently.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Freedom fighters from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," are likely to be at odds with anyone representing ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Trade Federation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Trade_Federation","referenceId":"reference:fb5a14e3938c63ab"},". Most of the time, they fight or outwit Battle Droids, but some confrontations include the federation's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Neimoidian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Neimoidian","referenceId":"reference:907b5a99c5e02624"}," leaders. These enemies might find themselves the targets of sabotage by The Naboo Resistance or assaults by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gungan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gungan","referenceId":"reference:f835c102d9e50780"}," forces.\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Naboo Resistance Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Nonheroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Royal Handmaiden"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Royal_Handmaiden","referenceId":"reference:ef42ba570a1bbb12"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Heroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jar Jar Binks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jar_Jar_Binks","referenceId":"reference:3fc883017bc76103"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sabé"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sab%C3%A9","referenceId":"reference:f9d66c679349e923"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Gregar Typho"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gregar_Typho","referenceId":"reference:7eae36a657bfcb56"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 8\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Padmé Amidala"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Padm%C3%A9_Amidala","referenceId":"reference:9ec3198cc43d2391"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Nym"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nym","referenceId":"reference:cb76da4fb487eca2"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 11\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Quarsh Panaka"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Quarsh_Panaka","referenceId":"reference:d0d59dd3d1583814"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 11\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Vehicles"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TYPE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["IMAGE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["N-1 Royal Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/N-1_Royal_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:6d2535c4072f2ec2"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 8\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
